This software builds upon DWSIM, an open-source chemical process simulator
licensed under GPLv3. See https://github.com/DanWBR/dwsim for details.

GPLv3 Section 13 explicitly permits combining GPLv3 code with AGPLv3 code.
The combined work is distributed under AGPLv3.

AGPL-3.0 was chosen over GPL-3.0 because this software is primarily served
over a network (MCP over HTTP/SSE). AGPL Section 13 ensures that modifications
to a network-served instance must also have their source made available,
closing the "SaaS loophole" present in plain GPL.
